      "id": "c-durability",
      "source_id": "c-durability",
      "question": "Which settings stop Acme losing acknowledged Kafka events?",
      "answer": "Acme producers set `acks=all`, so a write is acknowledged only after every in-sync replica has it [S1]. With `min.insync.replicas=2` on the topic, a single broker loss never loses an acknowledged event [S1].",
