      "id": "c-ordering",
      "source_id": "c-ordering",
      "question": "How do you keep Kafka producer ordering with retries?",
      "answer": "Retries can reorder records when more than one request is in flight [S1]. Setting `max.in.flight.requests.per.connection` to 1 gives strict ordering at a throughput cost [S1].",
