      "id": "c-breaker",
      "source_id": "c-breaker",
      "question": "What are Acme's circuit breaker settings?",
      "answer": "The carrier-tracking client opens after 50 percent of calls fail within a 30 second window [S1]. It stays open for 20 seconds, then moves to half-open with 5 trial calls [S1].",
