      "id": "c-lag",
      "source_id": "c-lag",
      "question": "What caused the tracking lag incident?",
      "answer": "A new enrichment step called an external geocoding API inside the poll loop [S1]. Slow calls pushed the time between polls past `max.poll.interval.ms`, so the group kept rebalancing [S1].",
